---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/sectors/"
pageId: "sectors"
title: "The Sectors"
description: "Fifteen sectors, one plan each. Every essential of a decent life — what it covers, where the cost pressure is, and where we are on it."
---
{#-
  Markup is the design export's own (design-source/pages/sectors.html), taken
  verbatim; only the 15 cards are dynamic. Each card's number, name, status
  chip, illustration and "what it includes" line come from the repository's
  sector dossiers via _data/catalog.js — the export's literal cards are
  replaced by the loop, nothing else is re-authored.
-#}
{% from "partials/content-needed.njk" import inline as gapInline %}
<!-- SECTION: sectors.Sectors — title -->
<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="Sectors — title"><h1>The <span class="t-coral">Sectors</span></h1></div>
<div class="introband">
  <h2>Fifteen costs. One plan each.</h2>
  <p>Living isn&rsquo;t one bill — it&rsquo;s fifteen. We map every essential of a decent life, go deep on three first, and keep all fifteen visible so nothing quietly falls off the list. Status is sequencing, not importance.</p>
</div>
<!-- SECTION: sectors.Legend -->
<div class="legend" data-screen-label="Legend">
  <span>Status:</span>
  <span class="status status--focus">Focus</span> <span class="t-fg2-500">building now</span>
  <span class="status s-next">Next</span> <span class="t-fg2-500">next wave</span>
  <span class="status s-future">Future study</span> <span class="t-fg2-500">high-safety, studied cautiously</span>
  <span class="status s-dossier">Dossier</span> <span class="t-fg2-500">research scaffold</span>
</div>

<!-- SECTION: sectors.15 sectors -->
<div class="sgrid" data-screen-label="15 sectors">
{% for sector in catalog.sectors %}
  <a class="scard{% if sector.statusClass == 'focus' %} focus{% endif %}" href="/sectors/{{ sector.slug }}/"><div class="top"><span class="idx">{{ sector.num }}</span><span class="status {{ sector.chipClass }}">{{ sector.status }}</span></div>{% image sector.illustration.src, sector.illustration.alt %}<h3>{{ sector.name }}</h3><p>{% if sector.includes %}{{ sector.includes }}{% else %}{{ gapInline("sector-includes") }}{% endif %}</p><span class="go">Read the dossier &rarr;</span></a>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- SECTION: sectors.Sectors CTA -->
<section class="blk blk--coral" data-screen-label="Sectors CTA">
  <h2 class="sec mw-18ch">Want a sector moved up the list?</h2>
  <p class="lead lead-52">Supporters help set what comes next through the advisory Assembly. The first step is free.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <a href="/pledge/" class="u-btn u-btn--ink">Sign the Pledge</a>
    <a href="/assembly/" class="u-btn u-btn--ghost">How the Assembly works</a>
  </div>
</section>
